      {
        "index": 1,
        "text": "When Mei returned to college, she needed a course that would fit around her job. The college offered tuition in the evening, but enrolment was falling. Some applicants lacked childcare, while others could not afford the fees. A tutor asked Mei to help investigate the problem.",
