      {
        "index": 2,
        "text": "Mei interviewed several adults about their access to education. Each learner had a different timetable, and much of the advice online was confusing. There was little information about financial support. She realised that a flexible curriculum would be useful only if people could actually attend the lessons.",
        "zh": "梅采访了几位成年人，了解他们接受教育的机会。每位学习者的时间安排不同，网上的许多建议又令人困惑。有关经济支持的信息很少。她意识到，灵活的课程只有在人们确实能来上课时才有用。",
        "start": 50.153333333333336,
        "voiceEnd": 75.6,
