      {
        "index": 3,
        "text": "The college has introduced a small grant for eligible applicants. Since September, Mei has been helping new students complete their forms. She completed her own application last week. The new assessment includes a practical project, so students can demonstrate skills as well as remember facts.",
        "zh": "学院已经为符合条件的申请者推出了一项小额助学金。自九月以来，梅一直在帮助新生填写表格。她上周完成了自己的申请。新的考核包含一个实践项目，让学生既能展示技能，也能记忆知识。",
